00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:31.640
any impending attacks the information that the CIA had that Abu Zubaydah was

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:35.080
the number three in Al Qaeda was just simply false he wasn't the number

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:39.080
three in Al Qaeda in fact he had never actually joined Al Qaeda he

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:43.920
wanted to and he ran Al Qaeda safe house and he established Al Qaeda's two training

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:48.080
camps in southern Afghanistan he was a bad man but he was not the number three

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:52.000
in Al Qaeda and he was not privy to the kind of information that the number

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:56.800
three would have as you pointed out before the FBI actually took a strong

